  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agreement with the Legal Assistance Centre (LAC) in Windhoek for support the Aids and Rights Alliance of Southern Africa (ARASA). The support is for all activities in the ARASA work plan for September 2004 - August 2006, co-funded by Development Cooperation Ireland (DCI). Activities include training in the region on HIV/AIDS and human rights, development of publications, joint advocacy activities.</narrative>
